{"strongs": "H1130", "word": "בֶּןהֲֿדַד", "translit": "ben-ha.dad", "root": "בלס", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "son of (god) Hadad", "definition": "בֶּןהֲֿדַד proper name, masculine (apparently son of (god) Hadad = Aramaic , ᵑ6 PS compare Bae Rel 68 ; also Babylonian Bin-addu-natan etc., Pinches PB Feb. 1883, 71 ; Assyrian Bir-Dadda COT 1Kgs 20:1 Hpt Hebraica 1885, 224 , but compare ᵐ5 υιὃς Ἀδερ , & Dl ZK, ii, 1885, 161 f. ; see also Schr KG 375 ff, 538 f. ) name for king of Aram Jer 49:27 in particular; — 1. time of Asa & Baasha 1Kgs 15:18 ; 1Kgs 15:20 = 2Chr 16:2 ; 2Chr 16:4 . 2. son of 1. (compare 1Kgs 20:34 ) Assyrian Dad-idri COT ( Bir-idri Dl 1. with) 1Kgs 20:1 ; 1Kgs 20:3 ; 1Kgs 20:5 ; 1Kgs 20:9 ; 1Kgs 20:10 ; 1Kgs 20:16 ; 1Kgs 20:17 ; 1Kgs 20:20 ; 1Kgs 20:26 ; 1Kgs 20:30 ; 1Kgs 20:32 ; 1Kgs 20:33 (twice in verse); 2Kgs 6:24 ; 2Kgs 8:7 ; 2Kgs 8:9 . 3. son of Hazael 2Kgs 13:3 ; 2Kgs 13:24 ; 2Kgs 13:25 compare Amos 1:4 . — see הדד .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1166')\">BDB1166</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1130')\">H1130</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1165')\">BDB1165</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1167')\">BDB1167</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>בֶּןהֲֿדַד</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> (apparently <highlight>son of (god) Hadad</highlight> = Aramaic <placeholder627/>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Syr')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ6</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <placeholder628/> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('PS')\">PS</lookup> compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bae')\">Bae<sup>Rel 68</sup></lookup>; also Babylonian <transliteration><highlight>Bin-addu-natan</highlight></transliteration> etc., Pinches<sup>PB Feb. 1883, 71</sup>; Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>Bir-Dadda</highlight></transliteration> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('COT')\">COT</lookup> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 20:1\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(11,20,1)\">1Kgs